      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Key Concepts:\n\n• SDLC Phases: Individual stages of software development lifecycle\n• Composable Workflows: Chain phases together for complete pipelines\n• Isolation Modes: Choose execution environment (shared, isolated, zero-touch)\n• Triggers: Multiple ways to initiate workflows (scheduled, event-driven, issue-based)\n• Support Modules: Shared utilities used across all workflows\n\nWorkflow Naming: adw_{phase1}_{phase2}_[iso].py",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Concepts:\n\n• SDLC Phases: Individual stages of software development lifecycle\n• Composable Workflows: Chain phases together for complete pipelines\n• Isolation Modes: Choose execution environment (shared, isolated, zero-touch)\n• Triggers: Multiple ways to initiate workflows (scheduled, event-driven, issue-based)\n• Support Modules: Shared utilities used across all workflows\n\nWorkflow Naming: adw_{phase1}_{phase2}_[iso].py",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 145
    }
  ],
